00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:55.324
Danny Hagueney asked, what is the inspiration for the slutty pumpkin and Gabe Silva one said, can you explain the connection or influence of, it's the great pumpkin Charlie Brown on this episode.
丹尼·哈格尼（Danny Hagueney）问，放荡南瓜的灵感是什么，加布·席尔瓦（Gabe Silva）说，你能解释一下两者之间的联系或影响吗，这是这一集里伟大的南瓜查理·布朗（Charlie Brown）。

00:05:55.324 --> 00:05:56.204
So there you go.
